      "synthesis": {
        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Complexes 1–4 were prepared by the same solvothermal procedure. A mixture of H2L (0.1 mmol), Co(OAc)2·4H2O (0.1 mmol), Ln(NO3)3·6H2O (0.1 mmol; Ln = Dy for 1), NaOH (0.1 mmol), EtOH (1.5 mL) and DMF (0.5 mL) was sealed in a 10 mL Pyrex tube. The tube was heated at 80 °C for 24 h. After cooling to room temperature, crystals of 1 were obtained. Yield 24% (0.0146 g) based on Dy.",
